{"title": "Roan Featherway", "pageid": 53418, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Roan_Featherway", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Authors"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Roan Featherway</b> is a druid of <a href=\"/wiki/Silvanus\" title=\"Silvanus\">Silvanus</a> and an author who wrote multiple journals, all unpublished drafts of books.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Roan Featherway is the author of multiple journals. In theses journals the fictive main character is a druid called Roa who travels through the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Emerald_Enclave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Emerald Enclave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Emerald_Enclave\">Emerald Enclave</a></span> and eventually faces down <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ketheric\">Ketheric</a>. In the end a druid named Balsin even praises Roa as the greatest of us all.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span